id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41435::$$$message_0298_0000_0000$$$::"This is Luviagelita Edelfelt,[br]heiress to a famed magical house, and phenom of the Clock Tower."::
41436::$$$message_0298_0001_0000$$$::"...Hearing her name now, it sounds like a new autumn menu item at a cake shop."::
41437::$$$message_0298_0002_0000$$$::"'A new character everyone's been looking forward to. When we showed both sleeved and sleeveless designs to the scenario writer, we got a "use both!" and the episode in which she tears off her sleeves was conceived.::
41438::$$$message_0298_0003_0000$$$::Her design points are her orange hair and white boots,'[br]says the character artist."::
41439::$$$message_0298_0004_0000$$$::"Huh...?[lr]::
41440::$$$message_0298_0004_0001$$$::I got thrown as a result of that drunken conversation?[cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01f(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01f(中)][shock vmax=20 time=500 count=10] Don't they realize how crazy that sounds!?"::
41441::$$$message_0298_0005_0000$$$::"Now now, settle down. Pro wrestling was always a part of Luvia's backstory. Your fate was sealed from the start."::
41442::$$$message_0298_0006_0000$$$::"...You look happy about it."::
41443::$$$message_0298_0007_0000$$$::"In her case, it isn't hard to see how they came to the logical conclusion of a dress with detachable sleeves."::
41444::$$$message_0298_0008_0000$$$::"Is that the conclusion in every parallel world...?"::
41445::$$$message_0298_0009_0000$$$::"Putting the source of the idea aside...[br]From a third-person point of view, your relationship is exactly the way close relatives loathe each other. Your brawling could give rise to friendship."::
41446::$$$message_0298_0010_0000$$$::"No way.[lr]::
41447::$$$message_0298_0010_0001$$$::Like one of those friendships that never give anything back? [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=10]Not in a million years!"::
41448::$$$message_0298_0011_0000$$$::"This is just some normal advice from me,[br]but you shouldn't speak ill of those who might stab[line len=2]I mean, watch your back someday."::
41449::$$$message_0298_0012_0000$$$::"Nooooo!"�~��